WEBVTT

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.080
It's here.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:11.880
The Floor Boss.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.750
Monster Rex Udaeus.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.630
Riveria, I'm doing this alone.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.210
I'll make it quick.

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:09.000
Monster Rex Udaeus.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:23.880
A colossal enemy, capable of wiping out
even large-scale parties...

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.000
...and she's facing it alone.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.500
There's no way she can win this.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:30.920
Tempest!

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:56.130
On top of that, she'll be the sole target of its attacks.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.210
Impossible... Udaeus has a sword!

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.130
Ais, look out!

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:52.790
Oh no-

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.670
Ais!

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:07.670
I need to step in.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:09.750
Don't!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:14.830
Don't... help me!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.080
Please, Riveria.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:22.210
Ais...

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.540
Tempest!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:34.880
Defeating an enemy far superior in strength,
overcoming one's own limits...

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.210
To achieve a tremendous feat
not even the gods can ignore...

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:43.170
The absolute condition
one must meet to raise their ability score.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.880
I refuse to be weak...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.290
to stagnate...

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.210
...forever mediocre!

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:11.500
More. More. More...

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.710
I have to be stronger!

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:16.040
Wind!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.130
She's dropped her defenses!

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.460
I will take it back!

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:47.960
Lil... Rafaga!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:55.080
To rush in and attempt to subjugate
a boss like that alone... Inconceivable.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.580
I'm... sorry.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.080
Ais, what happened?

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.630
I wanted to be stronger...

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:08.170
I'm well aware. But there's more to it than that, isn't there?

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.500
That woman...

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.420
The red-haired Tamer?

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:19.250
She called me... Aria.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.670
I see.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.040
So that's why she's been acting so strangely...

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:33.380
Ais.

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:38.330
Do you not trust me?

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.460
I... No.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:47.330
Tiona, Lefiya... ALL of us
think of you as part of our family.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.210
You do...?

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:57.880
You're not alone anymore. Don't forget that.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.960
Depend on your family more from now on.

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:06.000
I will... thank you.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.960
Now let us return. And rejoin our comrades.

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.750
C'mon, Lefiya, let's go home already!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.710
I'm sure Ais is totally fine!

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:23.170
But...

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:31.130
Miss "Storm of snow, three bitter winters!
My name is Alf!" Riveria is with her too.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:33.420
No need to worry!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.500
You're right.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:39.580
Exactly! Now let's go home
and get ready to welcome them back.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:40.580
Okay.

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.170
Let's get going!

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.040
Huh?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.960
Lefiya, we're leaving you here!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.500
C-coming!

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.880
Are you sure it was a good idea to leave it with him?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.790
Yes. It's not like I can wield it.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:04.040
Plus, the town could be attacked by monsters again,
and having a strong weapon is reassuring.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.830
It does seem valuable.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.420
Well, I'm sure he'll turn it into a great weapon.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.790
Although, it's the first time I've seen that dropped item.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.920
You've never seen it before either?

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.040
No.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.670
I've never known Udaeus
to wield a sword in the first place.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.710
Mind Down.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.250
He must have used magic
without thinking of the consequences.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:35.880
That boy...

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.630
What? Do you know him, Ais?

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:43.630
We haven't spoken directly, but...
he was the one with the Minotaur.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.830
The one Bete berated in the tavern, huh...?

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.540
Riveria...

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:54.040
I want to make it up to him.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.290
What do you think I should do?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.170
Well, you could...

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:04.540
Will that be enough?

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.580
Yes, I'd say it's enough to make things up to him.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.420
I'll start heading back.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.130
Um...

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:33.460
This could be tough...

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:39.000
I never thought Ais would come to me
for that sort of advice.

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.580
Let's see what happens...

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:49.460
Is this how you do it?

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.710
You've been... working hard.

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.420
Mother...?

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:20.380
Sorry, I'm not your mother.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.000
Am I hallucinating?

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.540
It's not a hallucination.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.750
That's right, I need to apologize...

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:46.250
Why does he always run away?

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.000
Ais, you're back.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.330
So? Were you able to apologize?

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.170
...again.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.080
What?

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.630
He ran away again.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.460
Sorry, I just-

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.790
What happened to them in the Dungeon?

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:20.960
No clue...

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.750
I couldn't apologize.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:33.540
It's all Riveria's fault.
She's the one who told me to do that...

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:38.920
Is he afraid of me?

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:43.630
I need to have Loki update my Status...

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:50.040
Soma, Soma, booze from Soma!

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:51.580
Loki.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.380
Hm?

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.000
Oh, Ais!

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:56.750
Looky, looky! Got some special Soma brew!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.630
My Status, could you update it?

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:03.000
Oh yeah, we haven't done that yet, huh?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.130
Aw man, I've got a visitor right now, though.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.290
Then...

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:09.880
Then, it's fine.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.000
Hold up.

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.420
You can wait inside.

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:18.500
Welp, that's about all I know about it.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.170
Was it any help to you, Eina dear?

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.710
Yes, thank you very much.

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:29.130
C'mon, Ais! Quit lookin' so grim
and let's go update your Status!

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:31.580
You went all out in the Dungeon, didn'cha?

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.960
Time to ravage that soft skin o' yours!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.790
Try anything weird and I'll stab you.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.130
For real?!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:05.830
Ais, you're finally Lv.6!

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.580
Congrats, Aisy-poo!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:21.880
We've got four Lv.6s in the Familia now:
Finn, Riveria, Gareth, and now you!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.540
Ain't that great?

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.630
Huh? Aren'cha happy?

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.750
It's the Rank-Up you've been waiting for, Ais!

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:35.040
I'm happy, but...

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.540
Well ain't that a sight to see?

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:44.670
Ais, worryin' about somethin' other than gettin' stronger.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.500
What's wrong with me...?

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.580
So Ais has finally made it to Lv.6.

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:59.040
Think that's going to provoke the others?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.580
As long as they don't go do anything foolish.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.580
Well, having a boost of morale is a good thing.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:09.130
Sure is! Guess you guys've
gotta keep your wits about ya now, huh?

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:10.630
Indeed.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.000
'Kay, let's get started then.

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:17.000
Let's go over what's been happenin' around here lately.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:23.880
The Magic Stone Tione retrieved on the 50th Level
and the one Loki and Bete picked up the other day...

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:26.750
are almost identical to one another.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:30.080
So the new species, the incident at Monsterphilia,

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:34.250
as well as the murder and assault
in Rivira are all somehow connected.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:36.330
From the surface to the deeper levels...

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.580
By the scale of all this,

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:42.710
there may be some truth in Lord Dionysus's claim
that the Guild is pulling the strings.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:46.460
I agree. Although, I think that may be a bit too simple.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.130
Loki, did you pick up on anything when you went in?

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.460
Nada. Couldn't really tell.

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:55.830
Somethin's definitely up, though.
I think we should stay suspicious.

00:15:56.790 --> 00:16:00.000
I mean, Dionysus is pretty fishy himself.

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:03.380
In other words, we shouldn't trust anyone.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:08.000
Well, we basically got dragged into this
and no one's gotten hurt so far.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:12.040
If it's gonna get crazy, maybe we should
just play it by ear for a while-

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:14.210
No, that won't do.

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:18.290
That red-haired Tamer that went after Ais...

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:21.540
Mmm, the one you said put up a fight against Finn?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:26.710
Apparently... she called Ais "Aria" when they spoke.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.540
You serious?

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:31.830
Yes. Ais told me about it.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:37.420
I see. So that's what Ais was so worked up about.

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:42.880
She can control the new monster species,
mutate them with a crystal orb,

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:46.830
plus she has knowledge of Ais' personal affairs?

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:53.080
On top of which, she is completely unknown
in Orario despite having such skill.

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:56.710
Even if the Guild IS involved in all of this...

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:00.250
there's definitely a lot more to it than that.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.170
In any case, we should discuss this with Ais.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:07.630
What's that for?

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.290
You rang, Boss?

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.500
Could you call Ais in here for me?

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.790
Leave it to me!

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.210
That's convenient...

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.210
Well, you know.

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:25.500
Oh yeah! Let's discuss your next
expedition before Ais gets here.

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:30.040
Me and Phai-Phai have been talkin', see.

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:33.670
If we're going to be accompanied
by smiths from the Hephaistos Familia,

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:36.750
we can get by with the bare minimum
of weapons and armor.

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:41.250
And instead, we can bring Magic Weapons
to use against the new species.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:42.960
Gareth, what have you found?

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:47.380
I've gathered up the finest goods
from every weapon shop in Orario.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.170
Everything's in order.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:56.130
We'll have to decide how best to carry this out
despite having a limited knowledge of our enemy.

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:59.750
If we go, we'll need to be prepared
to do what's necessary.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:05.500
Yes. In that sense, this concerns all of us, not just Ais.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.250
Agreed. Let's prepare for the worst.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.710
Boss, it's Tione!

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:12.830
Come in.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:16.830
Huh? Where's Ais?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.170
About that...

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:22.630
It seems she's gone off to the Dungeon. Alone.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.080
I need to get my head back on straight.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.420
The sun's so bright today.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.130
Thank you for your hospitality the other day.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:41.540
I'm Eina Tulle of the Guild.

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:45.580
I saved an adventurer under your supervision?

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:48.880
Yes, and I wanted to thank you.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:54.500
You saved him a hairsbreadth away from being killed
by a rampaging Minotaur on Level 5.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.330
A Minotaur...

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:59.130
Yes. His name is Bell Cranel.

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:04.500
U-um, Miss Wallenstein...?

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.540
He isn't afraid of me, is he?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:14.080
P-pardon? Not at all! Mr. Bell Cranel
was very grateful that you saved him!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:15.670
Really?

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:16.750
Really!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.000
Thank goodness.

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:24.790
So, that white-haired kid's
about to get scammed by Arde, too?

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.460
Yeah. You can read where this is goin'.

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.630
Don't screw this up, guys.

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.710
Gotcha, Pal.

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.080
Do they mean...

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:35.790
Is something wrong?

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:42.920
Miss Wallenstein, I beg your pardon,
but could you please do me a favor?

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.670
I mean, come on...

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:52.130
Excuse me! Have you seen a boy
with white hair pass through here?

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:56.920
Will you please rescue Mr. Bell Cranel,
the adventurer under my charge?

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:00.630
It sounds like he's being dragged into something terrible.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:02.580
"Something terrible"?

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:05.080
Please, lend him your strength.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:09.960
I need to find him quickly.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:15.330
There he is!

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:20.250
Tempes-

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.750
Firebolt!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:26.670
That magic... he's not chanting.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:35.330
When I met him on Level 5, he was only a beginner...

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.330
How could he have grown this much
in such a short time?

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.250
Firebolt!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.040
I don't believe it.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.290
Outta my way!

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:50.540
Crap-!

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.000
Huh?

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.080
What the-?

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.000
Whoa...

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:08.170
I'm sorry! Thank you!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.830
I didn't get to apologize again...

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.420
What's this?

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:35.670
You spotted me.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.330
I underestimated you.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:42.830
Who are you?

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.420
A humble spellcaster.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.210
You might call me a mage.

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:55.920
Would it help if I told you that I was the one
who contacted Lulune Louie before?

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.540
Ais Wallenstein...

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:03.210
I'd like you to carry out a quest for me.

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:39.580
"Requests and Divisions."
